# The PKCS #12 files OpenJDK 27.0.1's `keytool` and Python's `cryptography`
# 50.0.2 made on 2026-11-24 of the same leaf and CA as `samples`, and the
# leaf's key as PKCS #8 under the schemes `openssl pkcs8` writes and
# `openssl pkcs12` does not. Each is a function only the tests call.

use bytes

